nà xià cì wǒ yě yào gǎn jǐn bǎ tā huá zǒu
Next time I'll swipe it away quickly too.

649
00:27:02,600 --> 00:27:05,200
那我想知道你老公的爸爸
nà wǒ xiǎng zhī dào nǐ lǎo gōng de bà ba
Then I'd like to know about your husband's father.

650
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:07,200
他会做这个直播吗
tā huì zuò zhè gè zhí bō ma
Will he do this live stream?

651
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:10,300
他现在没有
tā xiàn zài méi yǒu
He doesn't have it now.

652
00:27:10,366 --> 00:27:13,100
他说我不会我不会
tā shuō wǒ bú huì wǒ bú huì
He said I wouldn't, I wouldn't.

653
00:27:13,466 --> 00:27:18,900
可能过几年他真的想赚钱的时候
kě néng guò jǐ nián tā zhēn de xiǎng zhuàn qián de shí hou
Maybe in a few years when he really wants to make money

654
00:27:18,900 --> 00:27:20,133
可能会试一试
kě néng huì shì yí shì
Maybe give it a try

655
00:27:20,133 --> 00:27:23,766
那让他加油
nà ràng tā jiā yóu
Let him keep going.

656
00:27:23,766 --> 00:27:25,233
加油
jiā yóu
come on

